WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.576
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:32.846 --> 00:34.405
I'm hungry.

3
00:59.804 --> 01:01.304
If I do this,

4
01:02.334 --> 01:04.118
no one can touch you?

5
01:23.157 --> 01:24.803
What are you thinking?

6
01:26.566 --> 01:27.796
Nothing.

7
01:28.986 --> 01:30.477
Nothing what?

8
01:35.158 --> 01:37.159
Why are you like this...

9
01:37.911 --> 01:39.464
That's what I thought.

10
01:40.789 --> 01:42.320
And what about me?

11
01:43.250 --> 01:45.186
Why am I like this?

12
01:46.378 --> 01:47.847
That was my thought.

13
01:54.553 --> 01:57.055
Go back if you want to.

14
01:57.055 --> 01:59.611
I'll just live like this forever.

15
02:03.139 --> 02:04.561
Cho Yu Gyeom.

16
02:06.064 --> 02:09.065
Do you know when my mom ran away?

17
02:09.065 --> 02:10.189
I don't know.

18
02:13.405 --> 02:15.663
When I was nine.

19
02:15.663 --> 02:18.034
I really liked that man.

20
02:18.034 --> 02:19.369
Sae Ryeong!

21
02:19.369 --> 02:21.185
Mister!

22
02:21.185 --> 02:22.539
Oh my.

23
02:22.539 --> 02:24.666
Idiot.

24
02:24.666 --> 02:27.429
Not even knowing he would run off with my mom.

25
02:30.672 --> 02:34.076
Seriously! If you ran, you should have taken me.

26
02:34.076 --> 02:36.582
What's the point of running off without me?

27
02:37.929 --> 02:43.927
I acted so pitiful around him, yet I was so scary to Mom.

28
02:44.895 --> 02:47.849
I dropped so many hints to take me along.

29
02:49.425 --> 02:51.116
What do you mean?

30
03:00.786 --> 03:02.503
Listen.

31
03:03.163 --> 03:06.963
I was already pitiful or scary back then, Yu Gyeom.

32
03:07.918 --> 03:12.297
So you can't leave me.

33
03:12.297 --> 03:16.909
I don't plan on being left twice.

34
03:19.205 --> 03:20.734
Yu Gyeom.

35
03:20.734 --> 03:22.965
Don't you think that's too much?

36
03:26.561 --> 03:28.470
I'll let it go once.

37
03:29.085 --> 03:32.534
But if you leave me even one more time,

38
03:32.534 --> 03:36.238
I'm going to fall apart completely.

39
03:36.238 --> 03:37.280
Stop it.

40
03:37.280 --> 03:42.595
If I sink to the bottom and beg you to save me with a desperate look...

41
03:43.245 --> 03:44.575
Cho Yu Gyeom.

42
03:45.328 --> 03:49.453
How scary and pitiful will I seem to you then?

43
03:49.453 --> 03:51.295
Hey.

44
03:51.295 --> 03:52.786
Sae Ryeong.

45
03:53.672 --> 03:55.572
The teacher wants you inside.

46
04:05.767 --> 04:09.405
[7. The Sky After the Rain]

47
04:12.148 --> 04:13.908
[Episode 7]

48
04:17.237 --> 04:18.833
[Staffing and Labor]

49
04:29.583 --> 04:31.876
Why did you come?

50
04:31.876 --> 04:35.422
I had to come to Seoul, so I was coming straight to you.

51
04:35.422 --> 04:40.844
Well, I got the address wrong, so last night I ended up in a really weird place.

52
04:40.844 --> 04:42.653
Where was it again?

53
04:42.653 --> 04:44.306
Ui-dong?

54
04:44.306 --> 04:45.849
Ui-dong?

55
04:45.849 --> 04:48.272
It was so far away.

56
04:49.519 --> 04:53.649
But I bravely stayed at a nearby motel for the night.

57
04:53.649 --> 04:57.074
Are Seoul motels always this empty?

58
04:57.074 --> 04:58.737
It's all machines.

59
04:58.737 --> 05:00.405
I was so surprised!

60
05:00.405 --> 05:02.019
And there...

61
05:04.200 --> 05:05.785
Quick, tell me!

62
05:05.785 --> 05:07.159
Stop chattering.

63
05:07.159 --> 05:08.432
My head hurts.

64
05:09.185 --> 05:15.378
And then I turned on the TV there, and really, like this kept coming on!

65
05:15.378 --> 05:19.758
So I was totally flustered, not knowing what to do, sweating like this...

66
05:19.758 --> 05:21.635
Hey, what the hell!

67
05:21.635 --> 05:25.097
I'll kill you!

68
05:25.097 --> 05:26.180
Die!

69
05:27.265 --> 05:31.855
Seriously! I said I'll kill you! Die!

70
05:32.688 --> 05:35.447
- Why are you doing this? - What's wrong?

71
05:37.359 --> 05:40.447
Dul Hee! Are you okay? Open your eyes!

72
05:40.447 --> 05:42.284
Are you okay? No!

73
05:42.284 --> 05:44.662
Help me!

74
05:45.284 --> 05:47.933
Dul Hee! Dul Hee!

75
05:51.206 --> 05:54.543
Vitals are stable, mental status alert, and no neurological symptoms.

76
05:54.543 --> 05:58.463
A 3-cm laceration on the back of the head, but no skull damage on palpation.

77
05:58.463 --> 06:00.799
To be safe, we'll do a brain CT and check.

78
06:00.799 --> 06:04.052
If it's fine, we'll suture, book a follow-up, and discharge.

79
06:04.052 --> 06:08.556
However, the patient reports NRS 4 to 5 with RLQ rebound tenderness.

80
06:08.556 --> 06:10.600
She says pregnancy isn't possible.

81
06:10.600 --> 06:15.522
Still, I would do a urine hCG and abdominal CT and review the images.

82
06:15.522 --> 06:16.815
Cho Dul Hee?

83
06:29.141 --> 06:30.506
Her guardian?

84
06:31.221 --> 06:32.478
Over there.

85
06:46.345 --> 06:47.522
Kid!

86
06:48.346 --> 06:50.098
You have grown a lot.

87
06:50.098 --> 06:51.681
Sir!

88
06:51.681 --> 06:53.601
How old are you? Did you graduate?

89
06:53.601 --> 06:54.686
Sir, why are you here?

90
06:54.686 --> 06:56.020
How are we meeting here?

91
06:56.020 --> 06:59.512
Of course your tutor from medical school became a doctor.

92
06:59.512 --> 07:01.652
Sir, my sister!

93
07:01.652 --> 07:02.701
Yes, yes.

94
07:02.701 --> 07:04.577
Your sister is fine.

95
07:04.577 --> 07:06.410
Her head was cut.

96
07:06.410 --> 07:08.325
We stitched it. Three weeks and it'll heal.

97
07:08.325 --> 07:09.755
Yes, Sir.

98
07:09.755 --> 07:14.227
She keeps saying her stomach hurts, so a CT and X-ray, and blood tests, too?

99
07:14.227 --> 07:15.756
Yes, Sir.

100
07:16.666 --> 07:18.094
Maybe appendicitis.

101
07:21.880 --> 07:24.035
Appendicitis is... you know the appendix?

102
07:24.035 --> 07:26.486
- Yes. - Appendix. Surgery is all it needs.

103
07:26.486 --> 07:27.993
Then I'll do the surgery.

104
07:27.993 --> 07:29.137
Please operate, Sir.

105
07:29.137 --> 07:32.736
Right, to do surgery, we need a guardian's signature.

106
07:36.353 --> 07:39.276
And you're not the guardian, kid, are you?

107
07:43.526 --> 07:45.939
She has both parents too.

108
07:45.939 --> 07:48.127
Just like you. Right?

109
07:57.958 --> 07:59.918
I like you.

110
07:59.918 --> 08:02.504
Please answer by tomorrow.

111
08:02.504 --> 08:04.702
It's fine if it's a no.

112
08:05.590 --> 08:09.303
I know you'll say no anyway.

113
08:10.053 --> 08:11.836
But you really have to...

114
08:12.617 --> 08:14.234
give me an answer.

115
08:15.150 --> 08:16.806
That way, I think I'll...

116
08:18.228 --> 08:20.618
be able to give up.

117
08:25.068 --> 08:28.105
[Entrance - Exit 2]

118
08:38.234 --> 08:40.125
Hello.

119
08:40.125 --> 08:44.044
I'm calling to answer your question.

120
08:44.044 --> 08:45.465
I...

121
08:52.303 --> 08:54.893
Kid. Did you have a brother?

122
08:54.893 --> 08:55.932
No, Sir.

123
08:55.932 --> 08:58.382
Then is your dad this young-looking?

124
08:58.382 --> 08:59.871
No, Sir. That's not it.

125
08:59.871 --> 09:01.563
Then who is this?

126
09:01.563 --> 09:04.077
Hello. I'm Kim Jung Yeon.

127
09:05.147 --> 09:06.300
Relationship?

128
09:06.300 --> 09:07.728
A friend.

129
09:10.280 --> 09:12.824
I asked for a guardian, and you brought a friend?

130
09:12.824 --> 09:14.801
Well...

131
09:14.801 --> 09:16.761
Excuse me, but...

132
09:16.761 --> 09:19.289
Yes. Go ahead.

133
09:19.289 --> 09:25.275
Why do you call her kid and talk down to her?

134
09:25.275 --> 09:28.300
He was my tutor.

135
09:31.342 --> 09:36.431
Anyway, kid, a friend isn't a guardian, is he?

136
09:36.431 --> 09:40.261
And besides, he's not her friend. He's your friend. Right?

137
09:40.261 --> 09:42.359
But...

138
09:42.359 --> 09:44.004
My mom...

139
09:44.898 --> 09:46.149
The phone call.

140
09:50.384 --> 09:52.624
Aren't you doing the surgery?

141
09:52.624 --> 09:54.784
I didn't explain how urgent the situation is.

142
09:54.784 --> 09:56.689
- You need surgery now-- - I'll call!

143
09:56.689 --> 09:58.846
Now. I'll call my mom.

144
10:09.808 --> 10:11.102
Cho Sam Hee.

145
10:11.102 --> 10:13.525
I'm busy, so be quick.

146
10:13.525 --> 10:15.804
Mom. Well...

147
10:15.804 --> 10:17.359
I...

148
10:18.890 --> 10:22.170
I met Dul Hee...

149
10:23.121 --> 10:25.651
- What? - No, that's not it.

150
10:25.651 --> 10:30.111
But right now, Dul Hee is...

151
10:30.859 --> 10:33.237
Cho Sam Hee, she's not my daughter.

152
10:33.237 --> 10:34.401
I'm busy. Hanging up.

153
10:34.401 --> 10:37.409
- Mom, it's not that, right now... - Let me talk to her.

154
10:37.409 --> 10:40.248
Ma'am. This is Jeong Ju.

155
10:40.248 --> 10:42.842
Yes, do you remember me?

156
10:42.842 --> 10:45.334
Yes, the med student.

157
10:45.334 --> 10:48.408
Yes. I'm a doctor now.

158
10:48.408 --> 10:52.338
Your daughter, Cho Dul Hee, is my patient.

159
10:57.284 --> 10:58.984
It's appendicitis.

160
10:58.984 --> 11:03.142
It's the appendix, and it needs immediate surgery.

161
11:03.142 --> 11:06.403
But a parent has to sign for the surgery.

162
11:06.403 --> 11:11.781
If her parents were gone or unreachable, we wouldn't look this hard.

163
11:11.781 --> 11:13.686
But you're alive.

164
11:13.686 --> 11:16.032
You're even on the phone with me.

165
11:18.859 --> 11:22.878
Ma'am. Please don't think appendicitis is nothing.

166
11:22.878 --> 11:28.283
She could die in surgery, so come to Seoul and sign right now.

167
11:29.585 --> 11:32.035
It's two hours by train.

168
11:32.035 --> 11:38.327
As you know, untreated appendicitis can lead to peritonitis, then sepsis--

169
11:39.397 --> 11:40.723
Hello?

170
11:42.390 --> 11:44.931
Sir, is my sister really in that much danger?

171
11:44.931 --> 11:46.979
- Really... - Kid.

172
11:46.979 --> 11:49.319
Your mom's coming. Don't worry.

173
11:50.523 --> 11:52.096
I'm going into surgery.

174
11:52.096 --> 11:54.237
You said no surgery until Mom comes.

175
11:54.237 --> 11:56.484
Of course that was a bluff.

176
11:56.484 --> 11:58.050
- Hee Seok! - Yes, Sir.

177
11:58.050 --> 12:00.919
Contact anesthesia and get an operating room. It's an emergency.

178
12:00.919 --> 12:02.202
Yes, understood.

179
12:02.202 --> 12:03.482
See you later.

180
12:12.379 --> 12:15.631
If he's doing the surgery, I think she'll be fine.

181
12:15.631 --> 12:21.117
But earlier, Sir said death and peritonitis and appendicitis.

182
12:21.117 --> 12:23.139
He said so many things.

183
12:23.139 --> 12:25.949
I think he was just scaring her.

184
12:25.949 --> 12:27.694
To get your mom to come.

185
12:30.188 --> 12:32.607
I think she'll really be fine.

186
12:32.607 --> 12:34.484
Don't worry.

187
12:34.484 --> 12:36.070
Right?

188
12:36.070 --> 12:37.552
I guess so.

189
12:39.573 --> 12:41.230
By the way,

190
12:42.117 --> 12:46.667
about what you asked me earlier, I'm going to answer now.

191
12:48.937 --> 12:50.076
No.

192
12:50.076 --> 12:51.668
Shut up.

193
12:51.668 --> 12:55.100
Saying that now would be pouring oil on a raging fire, okay?

194
13:00.469 --> 13:02.252
Have you eaten?

195
13:06.025 --> 13:07.457
No.

196
14:29.974 --> 14:32.275
I don't want to.

197
14:32.275 --> 14:34.397
I won't. Never.

198
14:34.397 --> 14:37.525
I'll never break up.

199
15:36.157 --> 15:39.777
Hey, Lee Won Bae. Now you too?

200
15:39.777 --> 15:41.266
Hi.

201
15:42.172 --> 15:44.925
Hey, what happened to Kim Jin Mi?

202
15:44.925 --> 15:47.606
She should be locked up in a hospital.

203
15:47.606 --> 15:49.492
I really thought she was crazy.

204
15:49.492 --> 15:50.901
What's with the water balloon?

205
15:50.901 --> 15:54.085
Hey, I heard she'll be suspended.

206
15:54.850 --> 15:56.837
Hey, but Sung Sae Ryeong...

207
15:57.771 --> 15:59.702
She has nothing at all.

208
15:59.702 --> 16:03.818
Sae Ryeong's side can stay quiet, the teacher saw. It goes to committee.

209
16:03.818 --> 16:05.777
There's more than one witness.

210
16:05.777 --> 16:08.326
But what's with Sae Ryeong and Yu Gyeom?

211
16:08.326 --> 16:09.526
Are they dating again?

212
16:09.526 --> 16:11.379
Hey, they held hands.

213
16:11.379 --> 16:12.418
On purpose.

214
16:12.418 --> 16:15.663
I know. What is that? It's so over the top.

215
16:15.663 --> 16:18.236
What else? Can't you tell?

216
16:19.857 --> 16:21.555
Sae Ryeong, you're here?

217
16:23.004 --> 16:25.507
Sae Ryeong, you okay? Get home all right?

218
16:25.507 --> 16:28.635
Right. Didn't you catch a cold? I was worried.

219
16:28.635 --> 16:30.835
I'm fine. It's nothing.

220
16:30.835 --> 16:33.485
- Really, it doesn't hurt? - Yes, I'm fine.

221
16:41.776 --> 16:46.153
I thought I would sleep for an hour no matter what and wake up.

222
16:46.153 --> 16:47.195
I'm sorry.

223
16:47.195 --> 16:49.916
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. What do I do? I apologize.

224
16:51.533 --> 16:53.749
Does it hurt? It hurts, right?

225
16:54.870 --> 16:56.536
It hurts.

226
17:00.542 --> 17:03.462
I have been like this for over seven hours.

227
17:03.462 --> 17:05.379
Seven hours?

228
17:05.379 --> 17:06.825
What do I do?

229
17:06.825 --> 17:08.576
Let's go to the hospital.

230
17:08.576 --> 17:09.990
This is the hospital.

231
17:09.990 --> 17:11.367
Which department should I go to?

232
17:11.367 --> 17:13.177
Hospital, quick!

233
17:13.888 --> 17:15.453
It's not that bad.

234
17:15.453 --> 17:17.266
Then what do I do?

235
17:17.266 --> 17:21.589
Well, I'll at least buy you a meal.

236
17:22.569 --> 17:24.197
- Just that? - Well...

237
17:24.197 --> 17:26.939
Then a meal! And coffee! My treat!

238
17:27.955 --> 17:29.816
And I'll buy ice cream too.

239
17:32.358 --> 17:34.077
Okay.

240
17:34.077 --> 17:35.702
Go in first.

241
17:35.702 --> 17:37.406
Your mother came at dawn.

242
17:37.406 --> 17:39.498
Really? My mom?

243
17:39.498 --> 17:40.526
Yes.

244
17:40.526 --> 17:42.200
See your mother first.

245
17:42.200 --> 17:46.599
Then have a meal, coffee, and ice cream.

246
17:46.599 --> 17:47.651
Okay.

247
17:53.845 --> 17:55.311
Get out!

248
17:55.311 --> 17:56.526
I understood.

249
17:56.526 --> 17:58.100
"Get out," right?

250
17:59.726 --> 18:01.449
Dul Hee. Dul Hee.

251
18:03.503 --> 18:07.365
I didn't want to come either.

252
18:07.365 --> 18:10.866
I came because they said a guardian was needed.

253
18:12.279 --> 18:15.130
Did you tell her?

254
18:15.993 --> 18:17.743
Did you tell this woman?

255
18:17.743 --> 18:21.681
The hospital said they can't operate without a guardian, so...

256
18:23.067 --> 18:25.752
Then don't do the surgery!

257
18:25.752 --> 18:27.951
It's already done.

258
18:27.951 --> 18:29.698
Don't bother saying that.

259
18:31.800 --> 18:33.089
Get out!

260
18:36.013 --> 18:37.472
I said get out!

261
18:37.472 --> 18:38.677
Fine.

262
18:39.390 --> 18:41.018
I'm leaving.

263
18:41.018 --> 18:44.680
Mom, wait. Please, please.

264
18:46.261 --> 18:49.202
Dul Hee, listen to me, okay?

265
18:49.202 --> 18:51.256
That was really fast.

266
18:54.114 --> 18:56.240
What is that?

267
18:56.240 --> 18:58.788
I understood that. "What is that?"

268
19:00.484 --> 19:02.333
Get out!

269
19:03.108 --> 19:04.377
Now!

270
19:13.382 --> 19:15.439
You're full of energy.

271
19:15.439 --> 19:17.410
You're alive, Cho Dul Hee.

272
19:21.261 --> 19:24.686
Hey, it's that girl. Her again.

273
19:24.686 --> 19:26.801
Seriously, how pitiful.

274
19:26.801 --> 19:28.646
Seoul's nothing special.

275
19:36.642 --> 19:39.120
How sad for her.

276
20:25.120 --> 20:27.499
Making one million in a year.

277
20:27.499 --> 20:29.754
Now, what does this sentence mean?

278
20:29.754 --> 20:32.545
"Making one million in a year."

279
20:32.545 --> 20:35.089
It starts with a gerund.

280
20:35.089 --> 20:37.884
But there's the word "but" after it.

281
20:37.884 --> 20:40.220
[Cho Yu Gyeom] So what comes next?

282
20:40.220 --> 20:42.968
A sentence that differs from the one before.

283
20:42.968 --> 20:46.310
So, nothing in the preceding line.

284
20:46.310 --> 20:47.977
Then what is "preceding"?

285
20:47.977 --> 20:50.727
It means what came before.

286
20:50.727 --> 20:52.277
Do you understand?

287
21:08.582 --> 21:10.392
There was nothing.

288
21:11.418 --> 21:14.877
You earn one million in a year.

289
21:23.961 --> 21:26.558
The professor will be making rounds soon.

290
21:26.558 --> 21:29.988
He'll be delighted to see the state of this room.

291
21:31.897 --> 21:34.461
Hello, Ma'am. How have you been?

292
21:35.067 --> 21:37.341
How have you been, young Jeong Ju?

293
21:45.082 --> 21:48.245
And here's the lively Cho Dul Hee.

294
21:48.245 --> 21:49.617
I see you're strong.

295
21:49.617 --> 21:54.152
But if you keep moving like that, the stitches will tear and you'll need surgery.

296
21:55.661 --> 21:56.961
Though that won't happen.

297
21:56.961 --> 21:59.466
I put in two or three staples.

298
21:59.466 --> 22:02.614
Oppa? Why are you here?

299
22:02.614 --> 22:05.889
Hey. What do you mean, "Oppa"?

300
22:05.889 --> 22:08.829
"Doctor," I told you to call me Doctor.

301
22:08.829 --> 22:11.852
Ma'am, she always calls me "Oppa" like that,

302
22:11.852 --> 22:14.438
I don't know any sign language, but I know "Oppa".

303
22:14.438 --> 22:16.072
What?

304
22:16.982 --> 22:21.321
I already told her I can't sign.

305
22:21.321 --> 22:24.415
She still stubbornly signs to me.

306
22:24.415 --> 22:25.826
Ma'am.

307
22:25.826 --> 22:31.642
Dul Hee gets out in two days, but what comes next is a problem.

308
22:31.642 --> 22:36.427
What else would I use but sign! Don't talk to that woman.

309
22:36.427 --> 22:38.352
What's she saying, kid?

310
22:40.861 --> 22:43.316
Don't talk to Mom.

311
22:44.468 --> 22:47.472
Then who do I talk to? Your mom's the guardian.

312
22:47.472 --> 22:48.576
Talk to me.

313
22:48.576 --> 22:52.094
I'm my own guardian.

314
22:54.001 --> 22:55.701
She's her own guardian.

315
22:56.980 --> 22:59.775
That's not for you to decide.

316
22:59.775 --> 23:02.093
You, get out.

317
23:03.237 --> 23:05.240
"You"?

318
23:05.240 --> 23:08.601
Ma'am, did you see? She called me "you."

319
23:08.601 --> 23:12.320
That's why I quit tutoring her. It was so hard.

320
23:12.320 --> 23:13.624
Ma'am.

321
23:13.624 --> 23:15.120
Yes.

322
23:16.742 --> 23:19.046
I said get out, all of you!

323
23:22.651 --> 23:24.201
Excuse me.

324
23:24.201 --> 23:26.014
She says everyone leave.

325
23:26.887 --> 23:29.263
You're picking it up... Ma'am!

326
23:29.263 --> 23:30.294
Wait one moment.

327
23:30.294 --> 23:34.076
Anyway, Dul Hee only needs two more days here.

328
23:34.076 --> 23:39.778
But now she can't go back to where she lived in that state.

329
23:39.778 --> 23:44.461
Because the one who did that to her head lives there.

330
23:44.461 --> 23:46.341
Right, kid?

331
23:46.341 --> 23:47.735
Yes, Sir.

332
23:48.574 --> 23:50.909
She lives in the same building as that criminal.

333
23:50.909 --> 23:54.576
And he is out to kill Cho Dul Hee now.

334
23:54.576 --> 23:56.781
Right, kid?

335
23:56.781 --> 23:57.874
Yes, Sir.

336
23:57.874 --> 23:59.483
So here's the thing.

337
24:00.856 --> 24:04.742
I would like you to take her home.

338
24:16.974 --> 24:18.191
I...

339
24:19.859 --> 24:22.729
I can't take her, Jeong Ju.

340
24:25.527 --> 24:26.846
Right.

341
24:26.846 --> 24:30.072
You're Dul Hee's mother.

342
24:30.895 --> 24:32.550
No.

343
24:32.550 --> 24:34.488
I'm not her mother.

344
24:35.745 --> 24:38.689
I came because they needed a guardian.

345
24:40.389 --> 24:43.534
As you saw, I'm not her guardian.

346
24:43.534 --> 24:45.265
So, Jeong Ju...

347
24:45.265 --> 24:48.226
From now on, even if she's rushed to the hospital...

348
24:49.284 --> 24:51.430
Please don't call me.

349
24:51.430 --> 24:54.063
Contact her father instead.

350
24:55.684 --> 24:57.842
I don't have a daughter like that.

351
25:09.353 --> 25:11.455
I don't see your wife.

352
25:12.451 --> 25:13.535
Yes.

353
25:14.769 --> 25:18.382
My wife had family matters, so she went to Seoul for a bit.

354
25:18.382 --> 25:20.089
To her family's home?

355
25:20.719 --> 25:23.521
Did something happen?

356
25:23.521 --> 25:25.741
I don't think it's that serious.

357
25:27.422 --> 25:28.492
Jae Jin.

358
25:28.492 --> 25:29.640
Yes, Father.

359
25:29.640 --> 25:31.944
Tell your wife.

360
25:31.944 --> 25:35.262
Unless it's serious, a wife shouldn't visit her parents.

361
25:36.683 --> 25:39.159
- Yes, Father. I'll tell her. - Okay.

362
25:39.159 --> 25:40.480
I'm sorry.

363
25:43.084 --> 25:46.521
And about Hui Gyeong,

364
25:48.329 --> 25:53.033
tell her to come and go when Yu Gyeom isn't here.

365
25:53.033 --> 25:55.744
I'm not saying don't come.

366
25:56.787 --> 26:00.302
Just make sure she doesn't run into Yu Gyeom.

367
26:01.275 --> 26:06.067
But Father, Hui Gyeong comes to see Yu Gyeom--

368
26:06.067 --> 26:08.001
Do as I say!

369
26:13.282 --> 26:14.691
Hello?

370
26:15.470 --> 26:16.499
What?

371
26:16.499 --> 26:18.450
The machine broke down?

372
26:20.637 --> 26:23.284
I'll ask my father and call you back.

373
26:23.284 --> 26:24.553
Yes.

374
26:46.586 --> 26:49.069
What's that? Can I try it?

375
26:55.304 --> 26:57.011
Seriously.

376
26:59.640 --> 27:01.729
Just tell me not to, then.

377
27:01.729 --> 27:04.104
I'm still with Kim Ha Yeon.

378
27:04.104 --> 27:05.157
What?

379
27:07.703 --> 27:10.202
I didn't go back to you.

380
27:10.202 --> 27:11.597
So...

381
27:14.465 --> 27:16.409
Ease up.

382
27:16.409 --> 27:18.807
Before your pitiful act stops working.

383
27:44.944 --> 27:46.224
Yu Gyeom.

384
27:56.353 --> 27:58.991
I want to talk to you.

385
27:58.991 --> 28:00.743
Okay.

386
28:00.743 --> 28:02.421
Then where...

387
28:03.569 --> 28:05.035
Hey! Cho Yu Gyeom!

388
28:05.035 --> 28:07.776
Assembly! Hurry!

389
28:09.884 --> 28:12.449
I'll wait here. Go.

390
28:12.449 --> 28:17.825
Well, practice might run late.

391
28:18.709 --> 28:20.634
Then, 9:30 p.m.

392
28:20.634 --> 28:22.599
I'll wait at the beach.

393
28:22.599 --> 28:24.629
That works, right?

394
28:24.629 --> 28:27.229
Hey! Hurry up!

395
28:27.229 --> 28:28.416
Go on.

396
28:55.674 --> 28:57.552
How old are you?

397
28:58.592 --> 29:00.354
I'm 21.

398
29:01.346 --> 29:03.259
The most tiring age.

399
29:07.352 --> 29:09.173
Kid's boyfriend?

400
29:10.529 --> 29:12.564
No. Not at all.

401
29:12.564 --> 29:13.744
Then what were you?

402
29:14.354 --> 29:15.746
A friend.

403
29:21.408 --> 29:22.976
Then, Sir...

404
29:23.658 --> 29:25.370
That Dul Hee?

405
29:25.370 --> 29:27.402
What's your relationship with her?

406
29:30.959 --> 29:32.952
My student. Like Sam Hee...

407
29:34.711 --> 29:36.280
No?

408
29:36.280 --> 29:38.647
They didn't look alike at all.

409
29:45.065 --> 29:47.011
You're sharp.

410
29:48.393 --> 29:49.989
What?

411
29:49.989 --> 29:51.480
Hey.

412
29:51.480 --> 29:54.200
Cho Dul Hee is a scary kid.

413
29:54.200 --> 29:58.253
When I tutored her, she liked me...

414
29:58.253 --> 30:01.709
She would open her shirt and lunge at me, and I would run.

415
30:01.709 --> 30:04.848
I'm truly scared of her.

416
30:06.036 --> 30:08.222
You didn't seem scared at all.

417
30:09.173 --> 30:12.567
No. I'm so scared of her, really.

418
30:12.567 --> 30:13.835
Sir.

419
30:13.835 --> 30:15.403
Kid.

420
30:22.636 --> 30:25.263
So how did it go? Your family's soap opera.

421
30:25.263 --> 30:29.099
I ran away because I would be destroyed in the middle.

422
30:29.099 --> 30:30.885
That was a very wise choice.

423
30:30.885 --> 30:32.894
Good for you, kid.

424
30:32.894 --> 30:34.679
You should eat. Want some?

425
30:34.679 --> 30:36.444
No. I can get it myself.

426
30:36.444 --> 30:39.278
No, I'm already done eating.

427
30:39.278 --> 30:41.196
I'll bring it.

428
30:41.196 --> 30:45.471
[Staff cafeteria]

429
30:48.249 --> 30:50.069
He seems to like you.

430
30:50.069 --> 30:51.300
What?

431
30:51.300 --> 30:52.680
No.

432
30:52.680 --> 30:54.979
He doesn't like me.

433
30:56.209 --> 30:58.200
I like him.

434
30:58.200 --> 31:00.387
And I'll get dumped today, Sir.

435
31:01.800 --> 31:04.580
Sorry. I'm hopeless when it comes to romance.

436
31:07.929 --> 31:09.769
You must have been so hungry.

437
31:09.769 --> 31:11.787
It's my first meal today.

438
31:13.029 --> 31:14.102
Hey.

439
31:14.771 --> 31:17.796
Is your sister really not welcome anywhere?

440
31:17.796 --> 31:19.947
Yes, Sir.

441
31:19.947 --> 31:21.061
No,

442
31:22.111 --> 31:25.585
What good life did she live to have nowhere to go?

443
31:25.585 --> 31:27.609
Sir, should I buy you coffee?

444
31:27.609 --> 31:28.821
No.

445
31:33.079 --> 31:34.733
How long will she live so well?

446
31:34.733 --> 31:37.599
You still like cafe latte, right, Sir?

447
31:40.422 --> 31:42.551
- Buy me one? - Yes.

448
31:44.092 --> 31:45.869
Get out.

449
31:46.783 --> 31:49.269
I said get lost!

450
31:49.269 --> 31:51.255
Go to Cho Yu Gyeom.

451
31:54.227 --> 31:55.890
I'm leaving.

452
31:56.478 --> 31:59.727
You don't need to worry about me.

453
32:03.042 --> 32:06.929
People told me I left that house?

454
32:06.929 --> 32:08.406
Right.

455
32:08.406 --> 32:11.231
You left on your own.

456
32:11.231 --> 32:12.923
Who kicked you out?

457
32:19.834 --> 32:21.378
No.

458
32:21.378 --> 32:27.342
That house raises girls to become maids when they turn 20.

459
32:27.342 --> 32:32.432
I couldn't become a maid, so I had no choice but to leave.

460
32:32.432 --> 32:37.262
I couldn't stay there if I wasn't a maid, right?

461
32:39.106 --> 32:40.310
Right.

462
32:41.066 --> 32:42.406
I...

463
32:43.469 --> 32:46.584
I like living as a maid.

464
32:46.584 --> 32:50.580
Better than wandering like you.

465
32:50.580 --> 32:52.496
Do you like it?

466
32:55.537 --> 32:57.951
Mom.

467
32:57.951 --> 33:01.049
You must think you're living a pretty good life.

468
33:04.129 --> 33:05.882
Right.

469
33:05.882 --> 33:10.823
Mom, surely you know you're a maid?

470
33:13.108 --> 33:14.274
Mom.

471
33:15.400 --> 33:17.811
Mom. You're a maid.

472
33:17.811 --> 33:20.580
You only leave that house when you die.

473
33:25.469 --> 33:26.853
Cho Dul Hee.

474
33:31.408 --> 33:36.622
You carry designer bags and wear designer clothes.

475
33:36.622 --> 33:40.856
You ride around in nice cars.

476
33:40.856 --> 33:44.359
You give things to people who grovel.

477
33:44.359 --> 33:50.359
Did you think that made you the lady of that town?

478
33:50.359 --> 33:52.192
Don't make me laugh.

479
33:52.192 --> 33:55.638
You're just a maid.

480
33:55.638 --> 34:01.624
A lady on the outside, a maid inside.

481
34:04.441 --> 34:05.998
Are you done?

482
34:07.569 --> 34:11.997
You are a total wreck.

483
34:26.859 --> 34:30.305
[Gym]

484
34:53.106 --> 34:56.329
All right, good work, everyone. Dismissed.

485
34:56.329 --> 34:58.055
Good work, Sir.

486
35:04.543 --> 35:05.913
Cho Yu Gyeom.

487
35:34.988 --> 35:36.283
I have to go.

488
35:36.283 --> 35:37.513
Where?

489
35:38.825 --> 35:40.476
Call me later.

490
35:40.476 --> 35:41.981
Yu Gyeom. Listen.

491
35:41.981 --> 35:45.416
You don't find me scary or pitiful enough yet.

492
35:47.044 --> 35:51.529
That's why you still act tough about not breaking up with Kim Ha Yeon.

493
35:51.529 --> 35:53.826
You broke up with Kim Ha Yeon.

494
35:53.826 --> 35:55.802
You're the only one who doesn't know.

495
35:55.802 --> 35:57.804
Kim Ha Yeon gave up on you too.

496
35:57.804 --> 35:59.567
Hey.

497
35:59.567 --> 36:02.189
That's not for you to decide. Okay?

498
36:02.189 --> 36:07.648
Yu Gyeom, I have always told you, let's talk.

499
36:07.648 --> 36:09.413
You know,

500
36:10.329 --> 36:13.211
I really wanted to talk to you.

501
36:15.189 --> 36:18.806
Like the story about my mom I told you yesterday.

502
36:18.806 --> 36:20.385
And there's my dad too.

503
36:20.385 --> 36:21.828
Why?

504
36:21.828 --> 36:24.603
Because those stories make me pity you?

505
36:25.415 --> 36:26.805
Then I'll...

506
36:27.749 --> 36:30.448
never leave your side?

507
36:30.448 --> 36:32.284
Right. Yes, Cho Yu Gyeom.

508
36:32.284 --> 36:33.379
You're smart.

509
36:33.379 --> 36:35.280
Yes, you're pitiful.

510
36:36.093 --> 36:38.136
Right. So forget Kim Ha Yeon.

511
36:38.136 --> 36:39.189
She's not pitiful.

512
36:39.189 --> 36:41.900
Right. You're truly pitiful.

513
36:41.900 --> 36:45.941
But the problem is I don't like you.

514
36:47.729 --> 36:48.858
What?

515
36:48.858 --> 36:50.782
I liked you at first.

516
36:52.378 --> 36:53.576
But not now.

517
36:53.576 --> 36:55.061
Not even a little.

518
36:55.061 --> 36:56.407
No.

519
36:56.407 --> 36:59.822
You came to me every time I was in a pitiful situation.

520
36:59.822 --> 37:01.824
So I thought about it.

521
37:01.824 --> 37:06.873
Kim Jin Mi made a fuss at me and I don't think it was that pitiful to you.

522
37:06.873 --> 37:08.957
What are you talking about?

523
37:08.957 --> 37:13.680
You never wanted to see my body.

524
37:13.680 --> 37:15.672
You wouldn't even be curious. Yu Gyeom.

525
37:15.672 --> 37:17.377
What are you doing?

526
37:27.477 --> 37:29.440
This isn't all there is.

527
37:34.186 --> 37:36.243
There's some here too.

528
37:36.243 --> 37:37.918
What is this...

529
37:40.976 --> 37:42.567
You know.

530
37:43.744 --> 37:47.955
When it gets late at night, I hate myself so much?

531
37:48.871 --> 37:50.417
What?

532
37:50.417 --> 37:54.846
Every time, I carved cuts into my body like this.

533
38:00.761 --> 38:03.154
Will you still leave me?

534
38:07.392 --> 38:08.576
Answer me.

535
38:08.576 --> 38:10.387
Will you leave me?

536
38:14.539 --> 38:16.127
I really...

537
38:16.966 --> 38:18.908
Sung Sae Ryeong, you...

538
38:18.908 --> 38:22.893
If you don't leave me, I have a reason to love myself.

539
38:22.893 --> 38:25.165
But if you leave me...

540
38:28.929 --> 38:31.144
I have no need to love myself. Yu Gyeom.

541
38:31.144 --> 38:32.177
Stop it!

542
38:32.177 --> 38:33.242
Answer me.

543
38:33.242 --> 38:35.900
Will you leave me even so?

544
38:36.546 --> 38:39.544
Please stop doing crazy things. This won't work.

545
38:48.892 --> 38:51.103
I knew you would be like this.

546
38:51.103 --> 38:55.438
You know, I knew I would come this far.

547
38:55.438 --> 38:58.341
How can you not feel sorry for me?

548
38:58.341 --> 39:02.444
How can you abandon me like this? How?

549
39:05.273 --> 39:06.884
How...

550
39:09.393 --> 39:12.661
can you not love me? Yu Gyeom.

551
39:15.249 --> 39:17.421
Please. Stop doing strange things. I...

552
39:17.421 --> 39:20.048
It may be very strange to you, but not to me.

553
39:20.048 --> 39:22.742
I'm desperate. That's why. Understand?

554
39:39.526 --> 39:40.617
Sung Sae...

555
39:40.617 --> 39:41.769
Hey.

556
39:47.073 --> 39:48.994
Hey, why aren't you coming out?

557
39:48.994 --> 39:51.619
Right. I'll pass out waiting...

558
40:17.812 --> 40:19.171
How do I...

559
40:20.693 --> 40:22.673
Look at this.

560
40:22.673 --> 40:28.068
Look at how cruel the world you gave me is.

561
40:28.909 --> 40:31.703
Sae Ryeong, no! Open your eyes!

562
40:31.703 --> 40:33.312
Please!

563
40:34.954 --> 40:36.159
What's with Sae Ryeong?

564
40:36.159 --> 40:37.325
Won Bae, get a teacher!

565
40:37.325 --> 40:40.337
I said get him now, you idiot!

566
40:40.337 --> 40:42.168
Sir! Sir!

567
40:43.814 --> 40:46.827
Shin Seung Chan. Call 119, please!

568
40:47.873 --> 40:48.917
Hey.

569
40:51.859 --> 40:54.182
Hey, what's wrong?

570
40:54.182 --> 40:56.142
Hey. Hold on.

571
40:56.142 --> 40:58.060
Cho Yu Gyeom, what's wrong with her?

572
40:58.060 --> 40:59.691
Let go of her.

573
41:00.399 --> 41:03.107
Sae Ryeong... she used that...

574
41:03.107 --> 41:04.820
her wrist...

575
41:06.041 --> 41:09.682
to cut her wrist...

576
41:17.040 --> 41:18.581
But...

577
41:19.835 --> 41:21.852
Yes. Go ahead.

578
41:22.588 --> 41:26.323
Why does your mother hate your sister so much?

579
41:30.095 --> 41:31.762
Because she left home.

580
41:33.473 --> 41:38.249
Even so, saying not to look for her next time she's hurt.

581
41:39.479 --> 41:43.453
Well, my family is a bit complicated.

582
41:47.112 --> 41:49.096
Grandfather is strict too.

583
41:50.715 --> 41:52.307
Yes, Grandpa!

584
41:53.533 --> 41:55.534
I'm taking a walk right now.

585
41:55.534 --> 41:56.627
Yes.

586
41:57.317 --> 41:59.868
Of course! I'm coming down today.

587
41:59.868 --> 42:01.692
Yes!

588
42:03.670 --> 42:05.424
Right.

589
42:06.673 --> 42:08.722
My grandfather is strict, too.

590
42:09.708 --> 42:11.869
It doesn't seem like it at all.

591
42:12.763 --> 42:16.097
With me, my grandfather's a pushover.

592
42:16.097 --> 42:17.673
A pushover?

593
42:17.673 --> 42:19.477
But not with my mom.

594
42:19.477 --> 42:23.964
So when Mom comes to Seoul, Grandpa gets really angry.

595
42:24.835 --> 42:27.113
But his granddaughter is sick.

596
42:27.113 --> 42:29.834
That doesn't work on him at all.

597
42:32.168 --> 42:34.163
That's a bit curious.

598
42:35.022 --> 42:36.742
Yes.

599
42:36.742 --> 42:39.366
There's a lot more curious stuff.

600
42:42.999 --> 42:45.278
Speaking of which, Jung Yeon.

601
42:45.278 --> 42:46.648
Yes.

602
42:47.399 --> 42:49.871
You can give me your answer now.

603
42:50.970 --> 42:53.708
The answer to my question.

604
42:59.473 --> 43:01.458
I'm ready to hear it now.

605
43:01.458 --> 43:05.392
Even if you pour oil on my heart, it won't catch fire.

606
43:06.216 --> 43:10.516
I'm much better now, and I'm fully prepared.

607
43:11.191 --> 43:12.421
Okay.

608
43:14.283 --> 43:15.786
Let's do it.

609
43:17.616 --> 43:19.379
Do what...

610
43:19.379 --> 43:20.869
Let's meet.

611
43:21.707 --> 43:22.814
What?

612
43:23.825 --> 43:26.211
Let's try dating. You and me.

613
43:26.211 --> 43:27.970
I'm fine with it.

614
43:36.413 --> 43:38.459
What happened?

615
43:38.459 --> 43:42.763
They say she suddenly cut her wrist with a razor, right in front of him.

616
43:44.964 --> 43:47.533
Seung Chan, look after him.

617
43:47.533 --> 43:49.047
Yes.

618
43:49.047 --> 43:50.733
What about Sae Ryeong?

619
43:50.733 --> 43:53.402
Sae Ryeong? She's in surgery. It had better go well.

620
43:53.402 --> 43:55.657
It'll go well. Don't worry.

621
43:55.657 --> 43:59.432
Hey, and do you know Sae Ryeong's home number?

622
44:00.412 --> 44:02.039
I don't.

623
44:02.039 --> 44:04.833
Honestly, these so-called friends...

624
44:04.833 --> 44:08.253
Should I contact the school?

625
44:08.253 --> 44:12.217
Her teachers are coming, but a guardian has to be here.

626
44:13.645 --> 44:15.114
Sir.

627
44:15.953 --> 44:18.006
Yes? Go ahead.

628
44:18.613 --> 44:20.953
What about Sae Ryeong?

629
44:20.953 --> 44:23.352
Her homeroom teacher would know.

630
44:23.352 --> 44:24.693
Right?

631
44:24.693 --> 44:26.228
What about Sae Ryeong?

632
44:26.897 --> 44:29.270
Why is she such a crazy girl?

633
44:53.924 --> 44:55.018
Hey.

634
44:56.273 --> 44:57.503
Drink.

635
45:02.140 --> 45:05.073
The coach went to Sae Ryeong's house.

636
45:05.073 --> 45:07.316
It was hard to reach her grandma.

637
45:11.006 --> 45:12.619
Are you okay?

638
45:15.654 --> 45:17.173
No.

639
45:17.173 --> 45:18.606
Not at all.

640
45:20.205 --> 45:22.368
Why is Sae Ryeong doing this?

641
45:25.811 --> 45:31.169
[Emergency Medical Center] Judging by the wounds and scars on her body,

642
45:31.169 --> 45:34.813
she seems to have self-harmed for years.

643
45:35.831 --> 45:38.617
She's very emotionally unstable.

644
45:38.617 --> 45:42.104
A patient like this should never be left alone.

645
45:43.307 --> 45:45.553
Seriously.

646
45:45.553 --> 45:48.893
It sounds like she wants me to stay with her.

647
45:48.893 --> 45:51.200
Just until she calms down. Okay?

648
45:51.200 --> 45:53.135
- We'll watch her. - Shin Seung Chan.

649
45:55.253 --> 45:56.764
What time is it?

650
46:02.025 --> 46:04.121
[9:30 p.m.]

651
46:41.153 --> 46:42.409
Sir.

652
46:42.409 --> 46:43.575
Mom has left.

653
46:43.575 --> 46:45.577
Yes, I know.

654
46:45.577 --> 46:48.200
But I can't go home.

655
46:48.200 --> 46:50.717
Because I'm on call.

656
46:51.329 --> 46:54.704
I was on call yesterday. Why am I on call today too?

657
46:55.501 --> 46:57.002
Kid.

658
46:57.002 --> 46:59.340
I studied so hard.

659
46:59.340 --> 47:01.463
Why is my life so exhausting?

660
47:03.759 --> 47:06.984
Sir, my sister really has nowhere to go.

661
47:06.984 --> 47:11.600
When I asked, she said she would have to go back where she used to live.

662
47:11.600 --> 47:17.102
The good news is the man who hit her was arrested.

663
47:19.358 --> 47:21.453
She lives in that gosiwon, right?

664
47:21.453 --> 47:23.404
Yes, Sir.

665
47:23.404 --> 47:26.951
Your family is richer than mine, so why does she live like that?

666
47:26.951 --> 47:28.452
I know.

667
47:30.976 --> 47:33.349
So in my house...

668
47:34.874 --> 47:36.811
there's a living room.

669
47:38.005 --> 47:39.165
So...

670
47:39.965 --> 47:43.719
Cho Dul Hee scares me, but when she's sick, it's a hassle.

671
47:43.719 --> 47:44.779
Sorry?

672
47:44.779 --> 47:49.868
So just let her stay at my place until she's better.

673
47:49.868 --> 47:52.269
And have her find a new home.

674
47:52.269 --> 47:55.245
You said she earned so much. Where did it all go?

675
47:55.245 --> 47:56.273
Where did it go?

676
47:56.273 --> 47:57.399
On alcohol.

677
47:57.399 --> 48:00.042
Her liver must be bad too then.

678
48:01.695 --> 48:03.159
Thank you, Sir.

679
48:03.159 --> 48:04.413
As for my mom--

680
48:04.413 --> 48:06.713
Forget it.

681
48:06.713 --> 48:08.901
I'm going to go sleep a little now.

682
48:08.901 --> 48:13.452
Even if I decide to sleep lots, I only get a little anyway, so a little it is.

683
48:14.997 --> 48:16.581
Heading down now too?

684
48:16.581 --> 48:20.377
Yes. My sister's friend is coming, so I'm heading home.

685
48:20.377 --> 48:24.885
To cook and do chores and all that. Right?

686
48:24.885 --> 48:26.646
That's right, Sir.

687
48:30.557 --> 48:31.921
Kid.

688
48:33.226 --> 48:34.852
Later,

689
48:35.935 --> 48:41.928
when I'm not tired, and your sister isn't scary,

690
48:41.928 --> 48:46.207
and when you have moved out

691
48:46.207 --> 48:48.535
and you're doing what you love,

692
48:49.504 --> 48:51.287
let's meet again then.

693
48:53.911 --> 48:56.038
Doesn't that mean we'll never meet?

694
48:56.038 --> 48:57.171
Please.

695
48:57.171 --> 48:59.460
You're only 20.

696
49:00.837 --> 49:01.945
Go on.

697
49:20.854 --> 49:23.190
Honey, are you on your way home?

698
49:23.190 --> 49:27.969
I got through today somehow, but I have nothing to say tomorrow.

699
49:35.828 --> 49:38.109
Excuse me, Manager Kim.

700
49:38.109 --> 49:42.389
Could you contact my husband for me later?

701
49:43.349 --> 49:45.215
Tell him I'm on my way now.

702
49:45.215 --> 49:46.784
Yes, ma'am.

703
49:46.784 --> 49:48.642
I'll do that.

704
49:48.642 --> 49:50.130
Thank you.

705
51:14.259 --> 51:16.014
[I wish you could come soon. I just want to see your face, even once!]

706
51:16.014 --> 51:17.986
[But Noh Si Ha, you shouldn't do this to me]

707
51:24.952 --> 51:26.323
You can go now.

708
51:28.235 --> 51:30.743
Coach will be here soon.

709
51:30.743 --> 51:33.163
I'll hand off and leave as soon as he does.

710
51:34.430 --> 51:35.496
Hey.

711
51:35.496 --> 51:38.947
You have asked me the time once a minute since earlier.

712
51:38.947 --> 51:40.081
You know that?

713
51:41.412 --> 51:43.160
Meeting someone?

714
51:43.834 --> 51:46.086
So go.

715
51:46.086 --> 51:48.306
You're going to see Kim Ha Yeon.

716
51:49.484 --> 51:50.614
Aren't you?

717
51:51.466 --> 51:54.029
Yes. Thanks. Really.

718
51:54.029 --> 51:56.094
- What? - Thanks a lot.

719
52:57.130 --> 52:58.479
Ha Yeon!

720
53:34.216 --> 53:35.617
Yu Gyeom.

721
53:42.619 --> 53:44.242
Am I very late?

722
53:44.242 --> 53:45.518
Sorry.

723
53:47.874 --> 53:49.257
No.

724
53:53.214 --> 53:54.796
Listen.

725
53:57.909 --> 54:00.213
I have something to tell you.

726
54:06.852 --> 54:09.208
Are you breaking up with me?

727
54:15.637 --> 54:16.982
No.

728
54:19.480 --> 54:22.055
I'm going to say I was happy.

729
54:26.635 --> 54:29.445
That it was so fun and good.

730
54:34.433 --> 54:36.408
I won't forget.

731
54:38.508 --> 54:41.170
No matter how much time passes.

732
54:50.347 --> 54:51.939
Listen.

733
54:53.197 --> 54:55.564
Can I touch you just once?

734
55:33.366 --> 55:34.780
Yu Gyeom,

735
55:35.562 --> 55:37.522
I have a dream now.

736
55:37.522 --> 55:40.285
Really? What is it?

737
55:43.031 --> 55:45.012
To be happy.

738
55:45.739 --> 55:47.893
What? That's it?

739
55:48.509 --> 55:49.922
Yes.

740
55:49.922 --> 55:52.466
I'll be so happy.

741
55:52.466 --> 55:54.202
That's my dream.

742
55:55.168 --> 55:57.547
Then I should be happy too.

743
55:58.380 --> 56:00.864
What makes you happy?

744
56:05.533 --> 56:07.189
Think about it.

745
56:07.189 --> 56:09.349
There must be one thing.

746
56:09.349 --> 56:11.497
That becomes your dream.

747
56:16.059 --> 56:18.106
Then for me, the sea...

748
56:20.486 --> 56:24.768
I want to swim with all my strength as far as I can go.

749
56:25.866 --> 56:27.533
That's my dream.

750
56:30.379 --> 56:32.326
Make that happen.

751
56:32.931 --> 56:37.377
I like it when you're in the water, going the farthest.

752
56:37.377 --> 56:38.667
Ha Yeon.

753
56:39.379 --> 56:41.891
If I meet you again,

754
56:43.694 --> 56:46.505
it'll be the moment I watch you do it.

755
56:46.505 --> 56:48.784
Ha Yeon. Please.

756
57:07.819 --> 57:10.070
I was eighteen.

757
57:10.070 --> 57:11.799
It was summer.

758
57:11.799 --> 57:14.247
Yu Gyeom was in front of me.

759
57:14.247 --> 57:16.551
It was a rainy night.

760
57:22.834 --> 57:25.910
I still can't forget that night.

761
57:53.658 --> 57:58.726
If someone told me to leave just one day of everything you went through,

762
58:01.151 --> 58:04.765
It wasn't the night we met that I wanted to keep.

763
58:04.765 --> 58:08.091
It was the night we parted.

764
58:08.979 --> 58:15.351
Some things drain all my feelings more at the end than at the start.

765
58:17.686 --> 58:19.583
Love is like that.

766
59:02.901 --> 59:04.253
You came?

767
59:07.864 --> 59:09.708
Glad you came, Yu Gyeom.

768
59:13.784 --> 59:15.108
Yu Gyeom.

769
59:15.825 --> 59:18.413
You can go anywhere.

770
59:18.413 --> 59:19.993
I can understand.

771
59:19.993 --> 59:22.068
Wherever you go, whatever you do.

772
59:23.050 --> 59:24.409
Really.

773
59:24.409 --> 59:26.102
I don't care anymore.

774
59:28.067 --> 59:29.684
But Yu Gyeom,

775
59:31.899 --> 59:34.213
just come back to me.

776
59:37.612 --> 59:39.747
Just come back to me like this.

777
59:40.515 --> 59:42.755
That's all I need.

778
59:47.068 --> 59:49.553
No rain falls forever.

779
59:50.949 --> 59:54.570
One day, it will surely clear.

780
01:00:03.041 --> 01:00:06.470
Love is just like that.
